      "content": "hey, i'm trying to sort out travel docs for a group of 6 engineers heading through vietnam and thailand next month. we have some layovers in places like singapore and maybe some short hops into malaysia. turns out the distinction between transit visas and actual entry visas is all over the place depending on the airport. can u make me a quick checklist or guide on what we actually need to look for so nobody gets stuck at a gate or detained? thanks.",
